On March 10th, 2007, the dwellers of rec.games.roguelike.development
were again challenged to write a new, complete, playable, roguelike in
the scary span of just 168 hours. This was the fourth time such quest
had been issued, and developers from all around the globe attended the
call.

Again, twenty brave souls dared to challenge the impossible. Of those,
seven have provided proof of their heroic deed. All of them, however,
should be honoured for having taken on this challenge.

